                <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                    Sistem kini menyokong carian pelbagai hala. Anda boleh memasukkan <strong>Kod Soket</strong> (cth: 1155), <strong>Nama Jenama</strong> (cth: ASUS, MSI), atau <strong>Siri Model</strong> (cth: Tomahawk, ROG, Steel Legend).
                </p>

                <!-- Kotak Input Carian -->
                <div class="relative mb-5">
                    <input 
                        type="text" 
                        id="searchInput" 
                        placeholder="Taip soket, brand, atau model papan induk..." 
                        class="w-full pl-5 pr-12 py-3.5 bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl text-white placeholder-slate-600 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all shadow-inner text-base font-mono font-medium"
                        onkeyup="checkEnter(event)"
                    >
                    <button 
                        onclick="performSearch()"
                        class="absolute right-2.5 top-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 hover:from-cyan-400 hover:to-blue-500 text-slate-950 font-bold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all text-xs tracking-wide shadow-md shadow-cyan-500/10"
                    >
                        CARIAN
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Mesej Ralat Kotak Pemberitahuan Tersuai -->
                <div id="notificationBox" class="hidden mb-4 p-3.5 rounded-xl border bg-amber-500/10 border-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 text-xs flex items-start gap-2.5 animate-fadeIn">
                    <span class="text-sm mt-0.5">⚠️</span>
                    <span id="notificationMessage" class="leading-relaxed"></span>
                </div>

                <div class="flex gap-2">
                    <button onclick="clearSearch()" class="w-full py-2 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold border border-slate-700/50 transition-colors">
                        Kosongkan Input
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Bahagian Kanan: Paparan Dinamik Hasil Penapisan Komprehensif -->
        <section class="w-full lg:w-2/3 flex flex-col gap-6">
            
            <!-- Keadaan Sedia Kosong (Default View) -->
            <div id="emptyState" class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center py-24 px-6 border-2 border-dashed border-slate-800 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/10 backdrop-blur-sm">
                <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-4 border border-slate-800 shadow-inner">🎯</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-200">Sistem Sedia Imbas Perkakasan</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm max-w-md mx-auto mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                    Masukkan sebarang maklumat peranti komputer di bahagian kiri. Anda boleh mencari jenama seperti <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">ASUS</span> untuk melihat seluruh model mereka, atau kod spesifik model untuk melihat sokongan soket dan CPU.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Ruang Keputusan Carian Utama (Hidden Secara Asal) -->
            <div id="resultsSection" class="hidden space-y-6">
                
